erformance claims."},{"id":"linkedin","title":"LinkedIn Single Image Ads","url":"https://business.linkedin.com/advertise/ads/ads-guide/single-image-ads","accessStatus":"verified-content","checkedAt":"2026-10-24","basis":"Single-image formats distinguish image assets, native text, destination and device coverage. Recommendations are not universal organic-post limits."}],"placements.0.expanded.sources":[{"id":"editorial","title":"Creative AI placement design principles","url":"local:knowledge/design-principles.md","publisher":"Creative AI","authority":"editorial","accessStatus":"editorial","accessCheckedAt":"2026-10-04","verifiedAt":null,"sourceVersion":"page observed 2026-10-04","section":"","summary":"","limitations":"Authored heuristics; no measured performance claim; evaluated 2026-10-04."},{"id":"user:studio-output-presets","title":"Selected Studio output presets","url":"user-supplied:creative-ai-output-presets","verifiedAt":"2026-10-09","limitations":"Application presets selected in the brief. Physical sizes and margins are editable job specifications, not universal printer standards. Raster/PDF proofs do not certify publisher or press acceptance.","publisher":"user","authority":"user","accessStatus":"user-provided","accessCheckedAt":"2026-10-09","sourceVersion":"1.0.0"},{"id":"user:studio-placement-logo-policy","title":"Client placement logo policy v1","url":"user-supplied:studio-placement-logo-policy","verifiedAt":"2026-10-15"}],"facts":[{"id":"indian-brand-description","kind":"brand","text":"Sleepyhead’s official FAQ describes it as an Indian brand.","status":"supported","sourceIds":["source-1"],"essential":false}],"guardian.requirements":[{"id":"req-logo-integrity","text":"Use authentic Sleepyhead logo artwork and appropriate supplied variant; preserve its proportions, colours, contrast and clear space. Do not rotate, distort, recolour, bevel, emboss or add a drop shadow. No production logo artwork is present in the supplied materials.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-colour-source","text":"The excerpts specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042. The white specification conflicts: RGB indicates #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20. Treat white as unresolved; do not use #231F20 as white.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-typeface","text":"The excerpts name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. Font availability and licensing are unconfirmed; do not claim exact rendering unless verified.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"req-coherent-design","text":"Keep selected colours, patterns and mixed design elements cohesive; the excerpts call for bold colour, playful patterns and asymmetry.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]}],"guardian.preferences":[{"id":"pref-personality","text":"Supplied excerpts describe a human-centred, young/vibrant, quirky and playful Jester identity focused on connection and enjoyment. This is supplied positioning, not proof of audience response.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"pref-voice","text":"Favor humorous, informal, creative and personable language; keep it useful and clear, and avoid unsupported product promises.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"pref-whole-room","text":"As advisory inspiration, consider the whole domestic space—architecture, circulation, colour relationships, daylight, furniture grouping and lived-in activity. Expressive, patterned rooms and quieter alternatives are both represented; no single room formula is required.","sourceIds":["doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0","asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8","asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455"]},{"id":"pref-current-site","text":"The official site currently presents a broad home-comfort range and uses the lowercase Sleepyhead wordmark with orange accents. This is an observation, not a mandatory campaign template.","sourceIds":["source-1","source-5"]}],"guardian.visualRules":[{"id":"rule-palette-orange","domain":"palette","value":"Use the supplied brand orange #F15A22 as a specified brand colour.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-palette-charcoal","domain":"palette","value":"Use the supplied charcoal #414042 as a specified brand colour.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-logo","domain":"logo","value":"Preserve authentic logo artwork, proportions and clear space; do not rotate, distort, recolour, bevel, emboss or add a drop shadow. Prefer the master mark for general communication and use an appropriate authentic variant.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-type","domain":"typography","value":"The supplied excerpts specify Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. Exact font rendering is subject to availability and verification.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]},{"id":"rule-spatial-cohesion","domain":"layout","value":"Keep selected playful colours, patterns and mixed styles tied together by a coherent palette or design theme; the supplied excerpts also call for asymmetry.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"]}],"brandResearch.sources":[{"id":"source-1","kind":"site","status":"available","label":"Official brand website"},{"id":"source-5","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sleepyhead logo"},{"id":"source-8","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"source-9","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"source-10","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Official page image"},{"id":"doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","kind":"guidelines","status":"partial","label":"Visual world guide (supplied)","note":"All 1 sections indexed. 1 sections selected as text evidence; 0 actual v