uideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Visual guidelines · Sleepyhead S06 guideline excerpt.png","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sample creatives · Sleepyhead P001 spatial inspiration.jpg","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Sample creatives · Sleepyhead P022 spatial inspiration.jpg","note":"Actual image available as a visual reference in this brand’s next research refresh. Samples are not mandatory rules or product proof."},{"id":"source-approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951","kind":"asset","status":"available","label":"Approved brand library logo: Sleepyhead approved orange-charcoal · transparent","note":"User-approved uploaded logo 2026-10-15. Deterministic background removal explicitly authorized; shapes and opaque source pixels preserved. See approved-logos/2026-10-15/manifest.json. Two-tone logo; ensure BOTH colours contrast with background."}],"brandResearch.findings":[{"section":"overview","basis":"evidence","title":"Sleep and home-comfort range","text":"Sleepyhead’s official site presents a broad home-comfort range including mattresses, beds, sofas, sofa beds, recliners, pillows and other home furnishings. The site describes the brand as Indian.","sourceIds":["source-1"]},{"section":"identity","basis":"evidence","title":"Supplied identity guidance","text":"The supplied Sleepyhead guideline excerpts describe a human-centred, young/vibrant, quirky and fabulous identity, with a Jester archetype focused on connection and enjoyment. The excerpts are partial; their original version and approval status are not established.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-aae80100-00e7-4b25-ad96-67df3e41702f","asset-c4381a7b-d5aa-46af-95a9-7e2150bd0e23"]},{"section":"identity","basis":"evidence","title":"Colour, typography and mark","text":"Guideline excerpts specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042, and name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. The supplied white specification conflicts: RGB 255,255,255 implies #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20; treat #FFFFFF as an interpretation pending correction. The guide describes a lowercase wordmark and closed-eye “ee” motif; no production logo artwork or Migrena Grotesque font files are supplied.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-f455e529-b2b2-4944-b889-624c926d6bcf","asset-808c6451-265c-43e1-aa67-53fafd54f52d","asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac"]},{"section":"tone","basis":"evidence","title":"Conversational, playful voice","text":"Supplied voice guidance favours humorous, informal, creative and personable language, including wit and wordplay, while remaining useful and clear and avoiding unsupported product promises.","sourceIds":["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10","asset-fe0205c8-6774-40f4-9b95-f0e6827e968e"]}],"assets":[{"id":"approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951","kind":"logo","label":"Approved production logo from this brand library: Sleepyhead approved orange-charcoal · transparent","sourceIds":["source-approved-logo-asset-bc73e039c13b91fe41fd2951"],"brandId":"brand-3a5870df-d114-43eb-ba02-e5d8c3c729de"}]}}}
